  "comments": "Set of explanatory annotations written as interlinear notes to the base text, the Sambandha\u00adpar\u012bk\u1e63\u0101\u00adprakara\u1e47a (ID: 3775).\r\nThis probably corresponds to the work referred to as \"'brel brtag la 'bru 'joms\" in the list of Ral gri's writings (ID:7112), one of his three works on the Sambandhapar\u012bk\u1e63\u0101 (for the other two, see (ID:4947) and (ID:5515)).\r\n\r\nDiscussed and translated in English, together with the base text, in [WEPMCAYR].",
